From 2546a14e6b4ef957a90bce74c434eb213bd6bc91 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marco Carletti <mcarlett@ibm.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 14:33:55 +0200
Subject: Fix Spring Boot JBang export: use camel-test-spring-junit6

The camel-jbang Spring Boot export template declared the test
dependency org.apache.camel:camel-test-spring-junit5 without a
version, relying on the imported camel-spring-boot-bom to manage it.
Since the Spring Boot 4.0 upgrade the BOM manages
camel-test-spring-junit6 instead of junit5, so every exported project
failed at POM read time with:

  'dependencies.dependency.version' for
  org.apache.camel:camel-test-spring-junit5:jar is missing

This broke all TNB kamelets tests for CSB 4.22 (CSB-10482), where each
generated Spring Boot application failed to build. Switch the template
to camel-test-spring-junit6, which is managed by the BOM.

Fixes: CSB-10482

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../org/apache/camel/catalog/camel-jbang/spring-boot-pom.tmpl   | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/catalog/camel-catalog-provider-springboot/src/main/resources/org/apache/camel/catalog/camel-jbang/spring-boot-pom.tmpl b/catalog/camel-catalog-provider-springboot/src/main/resources/org/apache/camel/catalog/camel-jbang/spring-boot-pom.tmpl
index 67d2be49333..56a0c72314a 100644
--- a/catalog/camel-catalog-provider-springboot/src/main/resources/org/apache/camel/catalog/camel-jbang/spring-boot-pom.tmpl
+++ b/catalog/camel-catalog-provider-springboot/src/main/resources/org/apache/camel/catalog/camel-jbang/spring-boot-pom.tmpl
@@ -68,7 +68,7 @@
         </dependency>
         <dependency>
             <groupId>org.apache.camel</groupId>
-            <artifactId>camel-test-spring-junit5</artifactId>
+            <artifactId>camel-test-spring-junit6</artifactId>
             <scope>test</scope>
         </dependency>
     </dependencies>
